Z||000005||stsmithgt||03-19-2001||05:51 PM||||eh...With your hood open, lift the headlight door and feed the bungie through the top inner side like the two flaps are hugging the top of the hood.  Then hook them together.  It pulls the front of the <B>Colgan</B> bra nice and snug.  I've had mine since July of 99' and it would still look brand new if I didnt' catch it on a sticker bush while sliding sideways off the road down a dirt hill.  oooops.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  It has a couple little nicks in it now.  That reminds me.  I need a vinyl repair kit to make those disappear.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 03-19-2001).]||||reg||6
